  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="5f65cc8d-fbf0-4264-985d-80ccbb2ee4f4"><problem><para>
      <para>For questions 1 – 4, find the factored form of the quadratic expression.</para>
      <para>\(3x^2+ 16x + 5\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((3x − 5)(x − 1)\)</para><para>\((3x + 1)(x - 5)\)</para><para>\((3x − 1)(x − 5)\)</para><para>\((3x + 1)(x + 5)\)</para></problem><solution><para>\((3x + 1)(x + 5)\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \((3x + 1)(x + 5)\) .
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
